# Models fetched by install.sh from the addresses in URLS and checked against
# SHA256SUMS before use. None are redistributed in this repository.
#
# Every camera:
#   face_detection_yunet_2023mar.onnx    YuNet face detector, OpenCV Zoo          MIT
#   face_recognition_sface_2021dec.onnx  SFace face recognizer, OpenCV Zoo        Apache-2.0
#     (hashes: the Git LFS pointers in github.com/opencv/opencv_zoo)
#
# Regular webcams only (no IR camera):
#   MiniFASNetV2.onnx, MiniFASNetV1SE.onnx
#     Silent-Face anti-spoofing models by Minivision
#     (github.com/minivision-ai/Silent-Face-Anti-Spoofing, Apache-2.0), in the
#     ONNX export published at github.com/yakhyo/face-anti-spoofing (Apache-2.0);
#     hashes as listed on that release.
#   iris_landmark.tflite
#     MediaPipe iris landmark model by Google (github.com/google-ai-edge/mediapipe,
#     Apache-2.0), from Google's own model storage; read directly by OpenCV.
#   mobileone_s0_gaze.onnx
#     Gaze estimation (MobileOne-S0 trained on Gaze360) from
#     github.com/yakhyo/gaze-estimation (MIT); hash as listed on that release.
